 जाइए।": "mp3/3add06037083b3.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|अनुलोम विलोम। तैयार हो जाइए।": "mp3/9159e6aaeacb60.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|मालासन। तैयार हो जाइए।": "mp3/76129f493baea2.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Malasana (Deep Squat). Feet wider than hips, squat all the way down. Heels down (use a folded towel if needed). Palms together, elbows push knees out. Get ready.": "mp3/64f7ff91a86dd5.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Bhramari (Humming Bee). Sit tall, close ears with thumbs. Breathe in deeply. Breathe out making a low 'mmm' hum. Get ready.": "mp3/3e0705a986845b.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Breathe in": "mp3/f5d5fac73177b8.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Hum mmm": "mp3/0968743f2615d4.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Anulom Vilom. Sit tall. Close right nostril with thumb, breathe in left. Close left with ring finger, breathe out right. Breathe in right, out left. That's one round. Get ready.": "mp3/9a9c0bdbea1f25.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|सांस लीजिए": "mp3/3724ef20c0a42d.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|भ्रामरी। तैयार हो जाइए।": "mp3/f372c6ca2f017d.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|म्म्म गुनगुनाइए": "mp3/f227637e0bb4e9.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Kapalbhati. Sit tall. Short sharp exhales through the nose by pulling belly in. Inhale happens on its own. Get ready.": "mp3/d53afef656a39f.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|कपालभाति। तैयार हो जाइए।": "mp3/d0498ed2c2a6f0.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|उज्जायी। तैयार हो जाइए।": "mp3/87f7f044d11632.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|बॉक्स ब्रीदिंग। तैयार हो जाइए।": "mp3/7fa93e0a84e8b9.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Ujjayi Breath. Slightly close the back of the throat. Breathe slowly through the nose with a soft ocean sound. Get ready.": "mp3/30844528cff73b.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Mouth & Throat Exercises. Press whole tongue to roof of mouth, hold 5 s ×10. Say 'aaa' loudly for 5 s ×10. Push tongue tip to the back of the lower teeth, press the back of the tongue down ×10. Get ready.": "mp3/e70ae234b820c1.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|मुंह और गले के व्यायाम। तैयार हो जाइए।": "mp3/79e77aa2cb26f5.mp3", "en-IN-N