 रोकिए": "mp3/fdd63bcb43954c.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|हिप फ्लेक्सर स्ट्रेच। तैयार हो जाइए।": "mp3/3e0420d05e91ee.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Hip Flexor Stretch. Kneel on one knee, other foot forward. Tuck pelvis, shift forward gently. Feel stretch in front of back hip. Get ready.": "mp3/4cf1025dcaf7b8.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Gently push out": "mp3/29ad018e295550.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|रिवर्स कीगल। तैयार हो जाइए।": "mp3/98a9258c18cdc3.mp3", "hi-IN-SwaraNeural|धीरे से बाहर की ओर": "mp3/96d49425af919a.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Reverse Kegel. Breathe into the belly. Gently push out as if starting to urinate. Relax fully. Get ready.": "mp3/89248489e7559f.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Methi water or jeera water this morning?": "mp3/26f7fbdb49703f.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Good morning! Did you have a glass of warm water after waking up?": "mp3/cbbddbeb1a0945.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Kegel. Find the muscle that stops urine mid-flow (just to find it, not as practice). Squeeze 5 s, relax 5 s. Build to 10 s holds. Breathe normally. Get ready.": "mp3/c23972e2204b0f.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|What time did you sleep and wake up? Type like: 11 to 6": "mp3/84ef298a92e0e9.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|How was the snoring last night?": "mp3/a005a0d7e034b6.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|What is your weight this morning? Just type the number, like 97.4": "mp3/0cd006e60b2e0a.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Did you do your yoga and breathing today?": "mp3/b211f00f753314.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|What did you have for breakfast? Type it, like \"2 moong chilla and curd\"": "mp3/eeadbb1c2ab282.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Had your 2 tablespoons of seed mix today?": "mp3/a832e12272d1b1.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Did you train today?": "mp3/b55bcff1c6d5ca.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|How many steps today? Type the number": "mp3/6a1cd1842ec8f4.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Water check! Shall I add some?": "mp3/bed332b445b29f.mp3", "en-IN-NeerjaNeural|Ayurvedic drink time — which one today?": "mp3/95b7edc5f6e05c.mp3", "